    "text": "Two boxes launched on 16 September 2026 with the 30th Celebration expansion: the night-themed Greninja ex Box and the day-themed Sylveon ex Box. Each held its Pokémon ex as a foil promo, Greninja ex MEP 099 or Sylveon ex MEP 100, and as a foil jumbo, with four 30th Celebration booster packs and a code card for Pokémon TCG Live. In mainland China the same art came in the Greninja ex and Sylveon ex versions of the 30th Celebration Card Display Set.",
